---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Winston Koh">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last Updated: January 2026</strong></p>

      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Winston Koh (\"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") collects, uses, and discloses your information in connection with your use of our website (https://winstonkoh87.com/).</p>

      <h2>2. Data Collection</h2>
      <p>We do not collect personal data unless you voluntarily provide it (e.g., via email or WhatsApp contact). We may use cookies for basic site analytics (e.g., Google Analytics) to understand traffic patterns. By using this site, you consent to this.</p>

      <h2>3. Use of Information</h2>
      <p>Any information you provide is used solely to communicate with you regarding services. We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal identification information to others.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to third-party sites (e.g., GitHub, LinkedIn). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites.</p>

      <h2>5. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions regarding this policy, please contact me directly via the contact methods provided on the site.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 8rem 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #e0e0e0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fff, #888);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
  }
  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #ccc;
  }
  .container {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
</style>
